sequenceDiagram
  participant Pay as Payment Provider
  participant App as Laravel Billing
  participant DB as Business PostgreSQL
  participant Q as Outbox / Queue
  participant Net as Network Adapter
  participant Rad as FreeRADIUS SQL
  participant MT as MikroTik NAS
  Pay->>App: Signed payment webhook
  App->>App: Verify signature + event uniqueness
  App->>DB: Mark payment verified + invoice paid
  App->>DB: Insert network restore outbox (same transaction)
  App-->>Pay: Acknowledge accepted
  Q->>Net: Process idempotent policy command
  Net->>Rad: Update desired RADIUS policy version
  Net->>MT: Disconnect / CoA if required (lab verified)
  Net->>DB: Record success / failure
  MT->>Rad: New PPPoE Access-Request
  Rad-->>MT: Access-Accept + package policy
